{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41974","headline":"下蔡春暮旅怀 · 李中","name":"下蔡春暮旅怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"柳过春霖絮乱飞，旅中怀抱独[凄凄]。\n月生淮上云初散，家在江南梦去迷。\n发白每慙清监啓，心孤长怯子规啼。\n拜恩爲养慈亲急，愿向明朝捧紫泥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41974.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41974","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}